3. THIRD-PARTY & OPEN-SOURCE ACKNOWLEDGMENTS
================================================================================
Qelaro Browser is proudly built with and stands upon world-class open-source
technologies, frameworks, and filter lists:

- Chromium / Blink Layout Engine (BSD-3-Clause)
  Copyright (c) The Chromium Authors & Google LLC.
  Provides HTML5/CSS3 rendering pipeline, DOM parsing, and WebGPU standards.

- Google V8 JavaScript & WebAssembly Engine (BSD-3-Clause)
  Copyright (c) Google LLC.
  High-performance JIT-optimizing JavaScript runtime.

- Electron Desktop Platform (MIT License)
  Copyright (c) Electron contributors / OpenJS Foundation.
  Native window management, multi-process architecture, and GPU compositing.

- Node.js Runtime Platform (MIT License)
  Copyright (c) Node.js contributors / OpenJS Foundation.
  Asynchronous event-driven runtime powering filesystem, caching, and IPC.

- AdBlock & Tracker Rule Parser (GPLv3 / MPL 2.0)
  Filter rules maintained by EasyList, EasyPrivacy, uBlock Origin, and ABP.

- qrcode.js (MIT License)
  Copyright (c) Ryan Day.
  2D matrix QR code generator for instant mobile tab sharing.

- electron-updater & electron-builder (MIT License)
  Copyright (c) Vladimir Krivosheev / electron-builder contributors.
  Cryptographic binary verification and atomic differential updates.

